#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:42
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Ncurses"
msgstr "Instalação do Ncurses"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Ncurses for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare o Ncurses para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:46
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man \\\n"
"            --with-shared           \\\n"
"            --without-debug         \\\n"
"            --without-normal        \\\n"
"            --with-cxx-shared       \\\n"
"            --enable-pc-files       \\\n"
"            --with-pkg-config-libdir=/usr/lib/pkgconfig</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man \\\n"
"            --with-shared           \\\n"
"            --without-debug         \\\n"
"            --without-normal        \\\n"
"            --with-cxx-shared       \\\n"
"            --enable-pc-files       \\\n"
"            --with-pkg-config-libdir=/usr/lib/pkgconfig</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:57
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the new configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das novas opções de configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:60
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--with-shared</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--with-shared</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:62
#, xml-text
msgid "This makes Ncurses build and install shared C libraries."
msgstr ""
"Isso faz com que o Ncurses construa e instale bibliotecas C compartilhadas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:67
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--without-normal</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--without-normal</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:69
#, xml-text
msgid "This prevents Ncurses building and installing static C libraries."
msgstr "Isso evita que o Ncurses construa e instale bibliotecas C estáticas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:75
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--without-debug</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--without-debug</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:77
#, xml-text
msgid "This prevents Ncurses building and installing debug libraries."
msgstr "Isso evita que o Ncurses construa e instale bibliotecas de depuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:83
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--with-cxx-shared</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--with-cxx-shared</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:85
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This makes Ncurses build and install shared C++ bindings. It also prevents "
"it building and installing static C++ bindings."
msgstr ""
"Isso faz com que o Ncurses construa e instale vínculos C++ compartilhados. "
"Também evita a construção e instalação de vínculos C++ estáticos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--enable-pc-files</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--enable-pc-files</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid "This switch generates and installs .pc files for pkg-config."
msgstr "Essa chave gera e instala arquivos .pc para o pkg-config."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:116
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package has a test suite, but it can only be run after the package has "
"been installed.  The tests reside in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">test/</filename> directory.  See the "
"<filename>README</filename> file in that directory for further details."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote tem uma suíte de teste, entretanto ela só pode ser executada "
"depois que o pacote tiver sido instalado. Os testes residem no diretório "
"<filename class=\"directory\">test/</filename>. Veja-se o arquivo "
"<filename>README</filename> naquele diretório para maiores detalhes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The installation of this package will overwrite <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libncursesw.so.&ncurses-base-version;</filename> in-"
"place.  It may crash the shell process which is using code and data from the"
" library file.  Install the package with <literal>DESTDIR</literal>, and "
"replace the library file correctly using the <parameter>--remove-"
"destination</parameter> option of <command>cp</command> (the header "
"<filename>curses.h</filename> is also edited to ensure the wide-character "
"ABI to be used as what we've done in <xref linkend='ch-tools-ncurses'/>):"
msgstr ""
"A instalação desse pacote sobrescreverá <filename class=\"libraryfile\""
">libncursesw.so.&ncurses-base-version;</filename> no local. Isso "
"possivelmente quebre o processo de shell que esteja usando código e dados "
"oriundo do arquivo da biblioteca. Instale o pacote com <literal>DESTDIR</"
"literal> e substitua corretamente o arquivo da biblioteca usando a opção "
"<parameter>--remove-destination</parameter> do <command>cp</command> (o "
"cabeçalho <filename>curses.h</filename> também é editado para garantir que a "
"ABI de caracteres largos seja usada como o que fizemos em <xref linkend='ch-"
"tools-ncurses'/>):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:140
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">make DESTDIR=$PWD/dest install\n"
"sed -e 's/^#if.*XOPEN.*$/#if 1/' \\\n"
"    -i dest/usr/include/curses.h\n"
"cp --remove-destination -av dest/* /</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">make DESTDIR=$PWD/dest install\n"
"sed -e 's/^#if.*XOPEN.*$/#if 1/' \\\n"
"    -i dest/usr/include/curses.h\n"
"cp --remove-destination -av dest/* /</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Many applications still expect the linker to be able to find non-wide-"
"character Ncurses libraries. Trick such applications into linking with wide-"
"character libraries by means of symlinks (note that the <filename "
"class='extension'>.so</filename> links are only safe with "
"<filename>curses.h</filename> edited to always use the wide-character ABI):"
msgstr ""
"Muitos aplicativos ainda esperam que o vinculador seja capaz de encontrar "
"bibliotecas Ncurses de caracteres não largos. Engane esses aplicativos para "
"se vincularem a bibliotecas de caracteres largos por meio de links "
"simbólicos (observe que os links <filename class='extension'>.so</filename> "
"só são seguros com <filename>curses.h</filename> editado para sempre usar a "
"ABI de caracteres largos):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:152
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">for lib in ncurses form panel menu ; do\n"
"    ln -sfv lib${lib}w.so /usr/lib/lib${lib}.so\n"
"    ln -sfv ${lib}w.pc    /usr/lib/pkgconfig/${lib}.pc\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">for lib in ncurses form panel menu ; do\n"
"     ln -sfv lib${lib}w.so /usr/lib/lib${lib}.so\n"
"     ln -sfv ${lib}w.pc    /usr/lib/pkgconfig/${lib}.pc\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Finally, make sure that old applications that look for <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">-lcurses</filename> at build time are still buildable:"
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, certifique-se de que aplicativos antigos que procuram por "
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">-lcurses</filename> em tempo de construção "
"ainda sejam construíveis:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:161
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">ln -sfv libncursesw.so "
"/usr/lib/libcurses.so</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">ln -sfv libncursesw.so "
"/usr/lib/libcurses.so</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid "If desired, install the Ncurses documentation:"
msgstr "Se desejado, instale a documentação do Ncurses:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:165
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">cp -v -R doc -T "
"/usr/share/doc/ncurses-&ncurses-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">cp -v -R doc -T "
"/usr/share/doc/ncurses-&ncurses-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The instructions above don't create non-wide-character Ncurses libraries "
"since no package installed by compiling from sources would link against them"
" at runtime. However, the only known binary-only applications that link "
"against non-wide-character Ncurses libraries require version 5.  If you must"
" have such libraries because of some binary-only application or to be "
"compliant with LSB, build the package again with the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"As instruções acima não criam bibliotecas Ncurses de caracteres não largos, "
"uma vez que nenhum pacote instalado por compilação a partir dos fontes se "
"vincularia a elas em tempo de execução. Entretanto, os únicos aplicativos "
"somente binário conhecidos que se vinculam à bibliotecas Ncurses de "
"caracteres não largos exigem a versão 5. Se você precisa ter tais "
"bibliotecas, por causa de algum aplicativo somente binário ou para estar "
"conforme com a LSB, construa o pacote novamente com os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ncurses.xml:177
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make distclean\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --with-shared    \\\n"
"            --without-normal \\\n"
"            --without-debug  \\\n"
"            --without-cxx-binding \\\n"
"            --with-abi-version=5\n"
"make sources libs\n"
"cp -av lib/lib*.so.5* /usr/lib</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make distclean\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --with-shared    \\\n"
"            --without-normal \\\n"
"            --without-debug  \\\n"
"            --without-cxx-binding \\\n"
"            --with-abi-version=5\n"
"make sources libs\n"
"cp -av lib/lib*.so.5* /usr/lib</userinput>"

